00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:10.939
And in this conversation,
Speaker 2: Chuck Todd asks him,

00:01:10.939 --> 00:01:13.280
Speaker 1: Do you believe you were elected
fair and square?

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.429
Speaker 2: And he says, Yeah,
Speaker 3: yeah, I was.

00:01:15.429 --> 00:01:18.220
Speaker 2: And then he's asked about whether
Joe

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:24.539
Speaker 1: Biden was really elected fair and
square, and he says, Well, I do have concerns

00:01:24.539 --> 00:01:28.040
about election integrity,
Speaker 2: and he drops

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.579
Speaker 1: in a bunch
Speaker 2: of other coded language

00:01:30.579 --> 00:01:35.350
Speaker 1: that these people are now regularly
using to avoid dealing with the truth, truth

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.840
and addressing these issues
Speaker 2: substantively.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.590
