but it's worth seeing the full kind of arc

00:01:44.999 --> 00:01:46.150
of the conversation.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.539
So let's watch it.

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:49.749
And then we're going to have a conversation
