00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:05.880
The last president has not.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.470
What could the former president learn from
Bob Dole?

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:16.470
Well, we'll listen, I think that this is an
issue of election integrity, and I think that's

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.129
