their own laws and obeys their own constitution,

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.970
especially in a time of crisis.

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:22.770
So that's what's at risk for me right now
is maintaining the integrity of that election.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:27.989
And I want to do everything I can going forward
to make sure that those elections have even

00:03:27.989 --> 00:03:31.400
