levels of integrity.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.020
Americans value the sanctity of that, that
ballot booth.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:41.099
Do you believe you were elected fair and square
in 2020?

00:03:41.099 --> 00:03:42.349
You know, absolutely, I do.

00:03:42.349 --> 00:03:46.430
I think Kansas has some of the tightest election
